          "type": "subtitle",
          "settings": {
            "subtitle": "<p>Leaf & Bird exists to prove that clean beauty doesn't mean compromising on results. We formulate every product with full ingredient transparency — real ingredients that your skin recognizes, real results you can see, and nothing you can't pronounce.<\/p><p>From grass-fed tallow body care to clinical-grade serums, every product is made in the USA without synthetic fragrances, artificial preservatives, or harsh chemicals. We believe you deserve to know exactly what goes on your skin — and why.<\/p>"
